{"id":"easy-011","difficulty":"easy","title":"列表去重保序","description":"对整数列表去重并保持首次出现顺序。","function_signature":"def unique_keep_order(nums: list) -> list","entry_point":"unique_keep_order","constraints":"0 <= len(nums) <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)"},"required_edge_cases":["空列表","全重复"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,2,1,3]],"expected":[1,2,3]},{"args":[[]],"expected":[]},{"args":[[5,5,5]],"expected":[5]}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[1,2,3]],"expected":[1,2,3]},{"args":[[0,0,1,0]],"expected":[0,1]}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"集合保序","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(n)。","关键边界与处理策略":"空列表","代码实现":"```python\ndef unique_keep_order(nums: list) -> list:\n    seen=set(); out=[]\n    for x in nums:\n        if x not in seen:\n            seen.add(x); out.append(x)\n    return out\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}